  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco's Tactical operator hat features 3 separate loop fields: the front is for displaying flag and morale patches, the top is for attaching an IR marker, and the back is for mounting name tape.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "56437",
  "description": "<p>Rothco's Tactical operator hat features 3 separate loop fields: the front is for displaying flag and morale patches, the top is for attaching an IR marker, and the back is for mounting name tape.</p>\n<p><strong>Rugged &amp; Long-Lasting:&nbsp;</strong>These outdoor hats are built with a breathable 55% cotton / 45% polyester blend (MultiCam = 65% polyester / 35% cotton rip-stop) for unmatched resiliency and easy-to-care-for maintenance. These tactical field hats are not afraid to get down and dirty while out in the wilderness.</p>\n<p><strong>Keep Cool, Stay Focused:</strong>This tactical cap features 4 reinforced vents on the top to help circulate airflow around your head, allowing you to focus on the task at hand.</p>\n<p><strong>One Size Fits Most:</strong>Our tactical operator hats use an adjustable hook and loop strap for a snug fit that is perfect for most head sizes, ensuring the cap stays in place.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Got You Covered:</strong>Keep your head in the game with Rothco&rsquo;s collection of headwear and accessories. Designed with precision and purpose, our headgear is built to withstand the harshest conditions. Whether you&rsquo;re tackling the cold in one of our Watch Caps or Balaclavas, or out on a mission in a Boonie Hat or Fatigue Cap, our diverse range of headwear provides unmatched comfort and protection for everyone from active-duty personnel to outdoor enthusiasts.</p>",
